{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":317,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1915378,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285920,"Name":"Hbinning","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1471804972,"LastPoster":{"Id":231467,"Name":"gonzaloNunez","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1915378,"PostDate":1471804972,"PostContent":"Hi\u00a0everyone! I got engaged a few months ago and now\u00a0trying to narrow down a location which is\u00a0muc...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"harpreet_binning@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.3.78.183","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452980497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hbinning","Id":285920,"Name":"Hbinning","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.148.43.208","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0fe0b614734fa673da6a777cbe55c4e4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi&amp;nbsp;everyone! I got engaged a few months ago and now&amp;nbsp;trying to narrow down a location which is&amp;nbsp;much harder than I thought it would be. &amp;nbsp;I think i&#039;ve&amp;nbsp;somewhat&amp;nbsp;narrowed it down.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Does anyone have any information on any of them regarding pricing\/wedding packages and the resorts themselves. We want to stick to around a $1500 budget from Canada. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;We&#039;re trying to decide between:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Grand Bahia Principe Tulum&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Grand Bahia Principe Coba&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Sandos Playacar Beach&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Sandos Caracol&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Marina El Cid&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Thanks in advance!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915378,"PostDate":1471804972,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi\u00a0everyone! I got engaged a few months ago and now\u00a0trying to narrow down a location which is\u00a0much harder than I thought it would be. \u00a0I think i've\u00a0somewhat\u00a0narrowed it down.<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Does anyone have any information on any of them regarding pricing\/wedding packages and the resorts themselves. We want to stick to around a $1500 budget from Canada. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">We're trying to decide between:<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Grand Bahia Principe Tulum<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Grand Bahia Principe Coba<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Sandos Playacar Beach<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Sandos Caracol\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Marina El Cid<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Thanks in advance!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"harpreet_binning@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.3.78.183","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452980497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hbinning","Id":285920,"Name":"Hbinning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.106.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"726cc1d604548e283e9cdbda50577d88","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Good morning @[member=\"Hbinning\"] congratulations on your engagement and upcoming destination wedding. Also, welcome to the most amazing wedding planning community BDW.com!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We may not have an answer for your budget question but we&#039;re sure there is a member on this forum that can give you a hand. We&#039;ve been lucky enough to work at Sandos Caracol a handful of times and it&#039;s always been a wonderful experience. If your wedding ends up there we know you&#039;re going to have a great time &amp;lt;3 &amp;lt;3 &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At that, we&#039;ll leave you with some inspiration.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915389,"PostDate":1471867034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Good morning @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285920\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285920-hbinning\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Hbinning<\/span><\/a> congratulations on your engagement and upcoming destination wedding. Also, welcome to the most amazing wedding planning community BDW.com!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We may not have an answer for your budget question but we're sure there is a member on this forum that can give you a hand. We've been lucky enough to work at Sandos Caracol a handful of times and it's always been a wonderful experience. If your wedding ends up there we know you're going to have a great time <3 <3 <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At that, we'll leave you with some inspiration.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-63469200-1471866962.jpg\" title=\"Charlotte_Kristian_Teaser_05.jpg - Size: 89.2KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-63469200-1471866962.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Charlotte_Kristian_Teaser_05.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-19792500-1471867013.jpg\" title=\"Debbie_Kris_Teaser_02.jpg - Size: 99.7KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-19792500-1471867013.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Debbie_Kris_Teaser_02.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915389]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-26358900-1471866977.jpg\" title=\"Tiffany_Sean_Teaser_01.jpg - Size: 538KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-26358900-1471866977.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Tiffany_Sean_Teaser_01.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Jasmin & Matt - Breathtaking Destination Wedding & Lifestyle Photography<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\">\u00a0rating on <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Facebook<\/a> & <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21784-jasmin-matt-photography\/'>BestDestinationWedding.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Still not convinced? Read our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>testimonials of appreciation from previous couples <3<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<a><span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\">+52-1-984-114-3386<\/span><\/a><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ask us how we can help you plan your perfect wedding day.<\/span><\/span>","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464795939,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.194.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f7eb457d83c7a92c44947d6a2e039bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Hbinning, Congrats on your engagement and upcoming destination wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yes, you&#039;re right about selecting your wedding venue being a big piece in your planning process, however you&#039;re sure to find lots of great resources here to help with your decision.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One factor to consider if photography is important to you, is what the resort&#039;s outside vendor policy is. Bahia Principe resorts won&#039;t allow outside photographers on their premises, so you&#039;d need to be ok with using their resort photographer option.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ll share some magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured at the spectacular Sandos Playacar, to show you what a backdrop it would make for your photo memories.....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/06\/02\/Celebrations-hit-the-sand-at-Sandos-Playacar&#039;&gt;Sandos Playacar Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_ee1b6118795a42e6bb47207c99a550b3~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_ee1b6118795a42e6bb47207c99a550b3~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_ee1b6118795a42e6bb47207c99a550b3~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_6e48d805f9f24c05b71f0edf349a99ac~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_6e48d805f9f24c05b71f0edf349a99ac~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_6e48d805f9f24c05b71f0edf349a99ac~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_302f582b4c60490fac6245610109e3fb~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_302f582b4c60490fac6245610109e3fb~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_302f582b4c60490fac6245610109e3fb~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans, cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915397,"PostDate":1471881811,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Hbinning, Congrats on your engagement and upcoming destination wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes, you're right about selecting your wedding venue being a big piece in your planning process, however you're sure to find lots of great resources here to help with your decision.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>One factor to consider if photography is important to you, is what the resort's outside vendor policy is. Bahia Principe resorts won't allow outside photographers on their premises, so you'd need to be ok with using their resort photographer option.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We'll share some magical wedding moments that matter we've captured at the spectacular Sandos Playacar, to show you what a backdrop it would make for your photo memories.....taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/06\/02\/Celebrations-hit-the-sand-at-Sandos-Playacar' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sandos Playacar Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_ee1b6118795a42e6bb47207c99a550b3~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_ee1b6118795a42e6bb47207c99a550b3~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_ee1b6118795a42e6bb47207c99a550b3~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_6e48d805f9f24c05b71f0edf349a99ac~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_6e48d805f9f24c05b71f0edf349a99ac~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_6e48d805f9f24c05b71f0edf349a99ac~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_302f582b4c60490fac6245610109e3fb~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_302f582b4c60490fac6245610109e3fb~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_302f582b4c60490fac6245610109e3fb~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans, cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.196.6.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"00894bedc0fcec1bd1f3f386e7746f4e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Hbinning\"] Are you working with a travel agent? They can best help you with pricing, etc. for both travel and the wedding packages. Have you looked at the resort threads for each of these?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63282-official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63282-official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/164-gran-bahia-principe-akumaltulumcoba-post-here\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/164-gran-bahia-principe-akumaltulumcoba-post-here\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/66702-hotel-marina-el-cid-brides\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/66702-hotel-marina-el-cid-brides\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I couldn&#039;t find specific threads for the Sandos properties, but there are lost of posts that mention\/discuss them.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915401,"PostDate":1471892387,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285920\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285920-hbinning\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Hbinning<\/span><\/a> Are you working with a travel agent? They can best help you with pricing, etc. for both travel and the wedding packages. Have you looked at the resort threads for each of these?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63282-official-gran-bahia-principe-riviera-maya-thread\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...ra-maya-thread\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/164-gran-bahia-principe-akumaltulumcoba-post-here\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...coba-post-here\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/66702-hotel-marina-el-cid-brides\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...-el-cid-brides\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I couldn't find specific threads for the Sandos properties, but there are lost of posts that mention\/discuss them.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Now Sapphire review:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/5487-now-sapphire-riviera-cancun\/<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.67.9.47","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0d805dd7338cbd5b74afb9738f0b381","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;I would suggest reaching out to one of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;BDW Travel Agents&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;if you want to get some ideas on pricing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250);\"&gt;They specialize in Destination weddings. &amp;nbsp;You can&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;contact them HERE!&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span&gt;They are familiar with all these resorts and can be a great resource of information to help you narrow down your choices!!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915435,"PostDate":1472114168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">I would suggest reaching out to one of the\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>BDW Travel Agents<\/a>\u00a0if you want to get some ideas on pricing.\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(24,24,24);background-color:rgb(253,252,250)\">They specialize in Destination weddings. \u00a0You can\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>contact them HERE!<\/a>\u00a0<span>They are familiar with all these resorts and can be a great resource of information to help you narrow down your choices!!!\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285954345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.25.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2103c4eb2ddb9fe47b27171d0fe4448","RawContent":"Thank you everyone for your feedback! We ended up deciding on Sandis Playacar and have picked a date! October 26, 2017 :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1915619,"PostDate":1473772886,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you everyone for your feedback! We ended up deciding on Sandis Playacar and have picked a date! October 26, 2017 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"harpreet_binning@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.3.78.183","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1452980497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Hbinning","Id":285920,"Name":"Hbinning","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.189.63.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80267,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by gonzaloNunez, Today, 10:50 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1476298237,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a422bf8058134dfb4618093933643584","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey @[member=\"Hbinning\"]!\n\nGreat job!\n\nPlayacar is a nice place and the resort has a really good service, they take care on every detail, even the little ones ;)\n\nThey have some options for your big day, like this Tropical garden or may be you decide for the caribbean on the background. You can decide for the Gazebo at the beach. They have the best views in Playa del Carmen, i bet you, your family and friends are going to love them.\n\nLet me show you some of my photography job near Playa del Carmen... Enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;the best idea for getting prices is contacting a local wedding planner. check this out:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;www.rockingbride.com they can offer you rooms and planning.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;look at the color of this ocean, this was taken at Azul fives:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/fotosparablogs\/post11.jpg\" alt=\"post11.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915954,"PostDate":1476298206,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285920\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285920-hbinning\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Hbinning<\/span><\/a>!<br>\nGreat job!<br>\nPlayacar is a nice place and the resort has a really good service, they take care on every detail, even the little ones <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><br>\nThey have some options for your big day, like this Tropical garden or may be you decide for the caribbean on the background. You can decide for the Gazebo at the beach. They have the best views in Playa del Carmen, i bet you, your family and friends are going to love them.<br>\nLet me show you some of my photography job near Playa del Carmen... Enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>the best idea for getting prices is contacting a local wedding planner. check this out:<\/p>\n<p>www.rockingbride.com they can offer you rooms and planning.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>look at the color of this ocean, this was taken at Azul fives:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/fotosparablogs\/post11.jpg\" alt=\"post11.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/BDW\/firma.jpg\" alt=\"firma.jpg\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Gonzalo Nunez - WEDDING PHOTOGRAPHER - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com'>www.gonzalonunez.com<\/a> - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/GonzaloNunezWeddingPhotographer'>Facebook Fanpage<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum, Riviera Maya, Mexico, rest of the world.","Email":"info@gonzalonunez.com","IpAddress":"187.179.168.180","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1282081879,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gonzaloNunez","Id":231467,"Name":"gonzaloNunez","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80267","Title":"Help!","LastPostDate":1476298206},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
